sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Agent / UI / Service
    participant F as Loom facade<br/>(REST · MCP · SDK)
    participant P as Space policy<br/>(Loom)
    participant S as Lakebase Search<br/>(pooled KB index)
    participant M as Managed memory<br/>(store per space)
    participant SE as Managed sessions
    participant L as Lakebase<br/>(audit · traces)

    A->>F: retrieve(query, hints) + OAuth token
    F->>F: verify token with Databricks → user + groups
    F->>P: which spaces may this caller read?
    P-->>F: included: personal, project, team, company<br/>excluded: others (deny by default / hint)
    par fan-out in parallel
        F->>S: one hybrid query (vector + BM25),<br/>filtered to included spaces + caller principals
        S-->>F: ranked chunks (RLS re-checks access)
    and
        F->>M: BM25 search in each included space's store
        M-->>F: facts / preferences
    and
        F->>SE: (if session_id) recent turns
        SE-->>F: short-term state
    end
    F->>F: RRF fusion → per-space guardrails (redact, cap)<br/>→ dedupe → conflict resolution (authority → time → human)
    F->>L: audit rows + composition trace (one transaction)
    F-->>A: results with provenance + score breakdown + trace
    Note over F,L: Nothing is copied between spaces. Results are references into each space's own backend.
